Build Elowen

Create a complete, polished productivity website called Elowen.

Elowen is a collection of useful productivity tools presented through a clean, minimalist, professional interface. The website must be designed as a static website that can be hosted directly on GitHub Pages, without requiring a backend, database, accounts, authentication, or external server.

The repository currently contains:

* elowen.PNG — the Elowen image/logo. Use this image where appropriate in the website and use it as the favicon.
* upd — this file contains these build instructions.
* There may be no other files yet, so create the entire website structure as needed.

You are allowed to create, delete, rename, or reorganize files as necessary to produce a clean and maintainable project.

Core priorities

The finished website must be:

* Clean
* Minimalist
* Professional
* Fast
* Responsive
* Accessible
* Mobile-friendly
* Desktop-friendly
* Easy to maintain
* Compatible with GitHub Pages
* Fully usable without an account
* Fully usable without a backend

Do not use emojis as interface icons or decorative UI elements.

Use proper SVG icons or CSS-created icons instead.

Do not make the site look overly playful, overly rounded, excessively animated, cluttered, or like a generic AI-generated dashboard.

The design should feel calm, refined, intentional, and mature.

